I have just eaten. Have you finished yet?

50
00:02:53.252 --> 00:02:54.335
Your turn!

51
00:02:57.835 --> 00:03:00.650
I have just eaten. Have you finished yet?

52
00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:03.417
